    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Duffy is delighted to present 66 Kingswood, to the market. Positioned within one of the area's most sought-after residential enclaves along the prestigious Blackrock Road, this exceptional home represents the perfect blend of modern luxury, versatile living space, and an enviable coastal location. Beautifully presented throughout, it offers a rare opportunity to secure a true turn-key home designed with both family life and stylish entertaining in mind.\n\nFrom the entrance hallway, the home opens into an elegant formal sitting room anchored by a traditional cast-iron fireplace and a large window that fills the space with natural light. At the heart of the ground floor lies an expansive open-plan kitchen and dining area, a bright hub ideal for everyday family life and entertaining. The kitchen is fitted with sleek gloss cabinetry and integrated appliances, while the adjacent dining zone seamlessly connects the kitchen to the rear sunroom, making it an ideal space for hosting. Glazed double doors lead into a sunroom extension featuring vaulted timber ceilings, exposed pendant lighting, an integrated media wall, and garden views. Completing the ground floor is a versatile front room, ideal as a home office, playroom, or secondary lounge.\n\nUpstairs, the home continues to impress with thoughtfully proportioned accommodation. The primary bedroom serves as a quiet sanctuary, complete with a private en-suite shower room. The additional bedrooms are equally well proportioned, offering bright, versatile spaces for family members or guests. A beautifully appointed main bathroom and a hotpress complete the upper level.\n\nExternally, 66 Kingswood showcases standout curb appeal with classic stone accents and a driveway providing off-street parking. To the rear, the private garden offers an ideal space for summer dining and outdoor relaxation in complete privacy.\n\nSituated on the highly regarded Blackrock Road, the location brings together the charm of a seaside lifestyle with the convenience of urban living. Residents are within minutes of Blackrock village, its vibrant seafront promenade, cafes, and sandy beaches, as well as top-rated schools, sporting facilities, and Dundalk town centre. Excellent transport links, including local bus routes and quick access to the M1 motorway, ensure an effortless commute to both Dublin and Belfast.\n\nViewing is strictly by appointment and highly recommended. Contact DNG Duffy today. \n\nDisclaimer:\nThese particulars do not form part of any offer or contract. All statements are provided for informational purposes only and should not be relied upon as representations of fact. Intending purchasers must independently verify the accuracy of each statement through inspection or other means. Configurations of kitchens, bathrooms, wardrobes, and other features may be subject to change without prior notice. Purchasers are advised to confirm the current specification at the time of booking. Neither the Vendor, Selling Agent, nor any of their employees or representatives have the authority to make or give any representation or warranty in relation to any property. Images and artist's impressions are for illustrative purposes only. Floor plans are not to scale, and all dimensions are approximate."
      },
